oPTJ("[{\"name\":\"TecladoMusical1\",\"type\":\"PlayKeyboard\"},{\"name\":\"Inclinación2\",\"type\":\"SmartphoneOrientation\"},{\"name\":\"DibujoLED4\",\"type\":\"MatrixDraw\"}]\n<xml xmlns=\"https://developers.google.com/blockly/xml\"><block type=\"main_loop\" id=\"taN7E7B7pe[QObHa5{qt\" x=\"-37\" y=\"288\"><statement name=\"allCode\"><block type=\"protobject_DibujoLED4_clear_set_4\" id=\"protobject_DibujoLED4_clear_set_4\"><next><block type=\"protobject_DibujoLED4_drawOnXY_set_2\" id=\"protobject_DibujoLED4_drawOnXY_set_2\"><comment pinned=\"false\" h=\"116\" w=\"380\">[it]Disegna un punto in base all'inclinazione: con il telefono orizzontale resta al centro, e più lo inclini, più si avvicina al bordo dello schermo.[it][en]It draws a dot according to the tilt: with the phone flat it stays in the centre, and the more you tilt it, the closer it gets to the edge of the screen.[en][es]Dibuja un punto según la inclinación: con el celular horizontal queda en el centro, y mientras más lo inclinas, más se acerca al borde de la pantalla.[es]</comment><value name=\"VAR\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"`22[?|Z:h5OXXzUtHl?K\"><field name=\"NUM\">4</field></shadow></value><value name=\"VAR2\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"9+=[E^W8bPv`#yY#!fb=\"><field name=\"NUM\">3</field></shadow><block type=\"math_arithmetic\" id=\"B,-Bfm.bGK#V,ycRppE|\"><field name=\"OP\">ADD</field><comment pinned=\"false\" h=\"116\" w=\"380\">[it]Trasforma l'inclinazione nella posizione del punto: la divide per 30 e la arrotonda, così resta tra −3 e 3, e le somma 4, il centro dello schermo. Risultato: una posizione da 1 a 7.[it][en]It turns the tilt into the position of the dot: it divides it by 30 and rounds it, so it stays between −3 and 3, and adds 4, the centre of the screen. Result: a position from 1 to 7.[en][es]Convierte la inclinación en la posición del punto: la divide por 30 y la redondea, así queda entre −3 y 3, y le suma 4, el centro de la pantalla. Resultado: una posición del 1 al 7.[es]</comment><value name=\"A\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"?%=O/M~6VR#Is51/7ZJh\"><field name=\"NUM\">4</field></shadow></value><value name=\"B\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"/H^Zkq1a/.9j@]_w(nj%\" disabled-reasons=\"MANUALLY_DISABLED\"><field name=\"NUM\">1</field></shadow><block type=\"math_round\" id=\"J{FwoT~]eK8Lfr{3+tAu\"><field name=\"OP\">ROUND</field><value name=\"NUM\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"O:t0F`4PI8PKB+jZV]fD\" disabled-reasons=\"MANUALLY_DISABLED\"><field name=\"NUM\">3.1</field></shadow><block type=\"math_arithmetic\" id=\"Ow3TT%)41*mtCHBLN}R2\"><field name=\"OP\">DIVIDE</field><value name=\"A\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"`Yow@raVJ4/2)kV}4Rwp\" disabled-reasons=\"MANUALLY_DISABLED\"><field name=\"NUM\">1</field></shadow><block type=\"protobject_Inclinación2_get\" id=\"^#6bw3OMy$!LOL@^H7df\"><field name=\"property\">oriY</field></block></value><value name=\"B\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"0C9^sAe4:KrA1w^oGLi/\"><field name=\"NUM\">30</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></value></block></value><value name=\"VAR3\"><shadow type=\"colour_picker\" id=\"hEUj9|}nJ.%xc,CM6kvE\"><field name=\"COLOUR\">#ff4444</field></shadow></value><next><block type=\"protobject_TecladoMusical1_frequency_set_4\" id=\"protobject_TecladoMusical1_frequency_set_4\"><value name=\"VAR\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\";WyvT$]7f1,3uQ+L!P^J\"><field name=\"NUM\">440</field></shadow><block type=\"math_arithmetic\" id=\"m0^,h.ZIA]d?)#rIo#_`\"><field name=\"OP\">ADD</field><value name=\"A\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"r*QCN9xzRYj;LLbblV8S\"><field name=\"NUM\">440</field></shadow></value><value name=\"B\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"*CmZA02RC,kvO6wKrFA$\"><field name=\"NUM\">60</field></shadow><block type=\"math_arithmetic\" id=\"Sre,)E*5IW^I6Xt.ycOH\"><field name=\"OP\">DIVIDE</field><value name=\"A\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"d`=x.fC?gsAvM`iL=(_q\" disabled-reasons=\"protobjectOrphan\"><field name=\"NUM\">1</field></shadow><block type=\"protobject_Inclinación2_get\" id=\"gBKvZ60B2Ua#Y@x%XG_G\"><field name=\"property\">oriY</field></block></value><value name=\"B\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"dix0+Mx$)Xk6|Gb$cax=\"><field name=\"NUM\">2</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></value><next><block type=\"protobject_sleep\" id=\"sMuF~][ImkbJA_wZn9bd\"><field name=\"timingType\">ms</field><value name=\"VAR\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"0~M(yqaVik!ny+7)PP^|\"><field name=\"NUM\">100</field></shadow></value></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></statement></block></xml>")